{"id": "str-id", "ok": true, "cmd": "wronskian", "ucas": "wronskian sin(x), cos(x) wrt x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "wronskian", "var": "x", "matrix": [["sin(x)", "cos(x)"], ["cos(x)", "-sin(x)"]], "wronskian": "-1", "independent": true, "witness_x": -0.05000000000000071, "witness_w": -1}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "central_differences", "points": 402, "max_diff": 2.896608734120898e-15, "passed": true}], "proof": {"kind": "numeric", "text": "W != 0 at a sample point"}, "files": [], "text": "Wronskian matrix of sin(x), cos(x) (row k: the k-th derivatives wrt x)\n  [ sin(x)   cos(x)  ]   the functions\n  [ cos(x)   -sin(x) ]   d/dx\n  W = det = -1\n  (W equals the numeric determinant at all 200 sample points of [-10, 10])\n  check: every entry matches central differences at 402 points (max relative difference 3e-15)\n  linearly independent: W(-1/20) = -1 != 0, so the functions are independent on every interval containing x = -1/20\n"}
{"id": null, "ok": true, "cmd": "limit", "ucas": "limit sin(x)/x as x -> (0)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "limit", "var": "x", "at": "0", "side": "both", "limit": {"kind": "number", "value": 1, "text": "1"}}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "numeric_left", "points": 22, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "Richardson-extrapolated values approaching the point"}, {"kind": "numeric_right", "points": 22, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "Richardson-extrapolated values approaching the point"}], "files": [], "text": "limit of sin(x)/x as x -> 0:\n  0/0: L'Hôpital: lim (cos(x))/(1) = lim cos(x)\n  = 1 (from both sides)\n  numeric from the left (a - h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 0.9983341665, 0.9999934896, 0.9999999746, 0.9999999999, 1, 1\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 1 (estimated error 0): agrees\n  numeric from the right (a + h, h = 0.1*2^-k, k = 0..21): 0.9983341665, 0.9999934896, 0.9999999746, 0.9999999999, 1, 1\n    extrapolated (Richardson): 1 (estimated error 0): agrees\n"}
{"id": 900719925474099312345, "ok": true, "cmd": "taylor", "ucas": "taylor sin(x) x at 0 order 5", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "taylor", "var": "x", "at": 0, "order": 5, "polynomial": "x - x^3/6 + x^5/120", "coefficients": ["0", "1", "0", "-1/6", "0", "1/120"]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "taylor_jet", "points": 6, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "coefficients against long double Taylor-jet arithmetic"}], "files": [], "text": "Maclaurin (Taylor at 0) series of sin(x) at x = 0, through order 5:\n  sin(x) = x - x^3/6 + x^5/120 + O(x^6)\n  as x -> 0; coefficients c_k = f^(k)(0)/k!: 0 1 0 -1/6 0 1/120\n  check: the coefficients agree with Taylor-jet arithmetic (long double) to 0\n  check: |f - P| = 1.98e-11 at x = 0 ± 1/10, 1.55e-13 at ± 1/20, 1.21e-15 at ± 1/40 (shrinks like h^7.0; expected >= 6)\n"}
