{"id": 16, "ok": true, "cmd": "gcd", "ucas": "gcd x^2-1, x-1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "gcd", "p": "x^2 - 1", "q": "x - 1", "result": "x - 1"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "exact_division", "passed": true, "text": "divides both, cofactors coprime"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "exact division"}, "files": [], "text": "gcd x^2 - 1, x - 1\n  = x - 1\n  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime\n  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)\n"}
{"id": 17, "ok": true, "cmd": "lcm", "ucas": "lcm x^2-1, x-1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "lcm", "p": "x^2 - 1", "q": "x - 1", "result": "(x - 1)*(x + 1)"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "lcm x^2 - 1, x - 1\n  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)\n    = x^2 - 1\n  check: both divide it exactly\n"}
{"id": 18, "ok": true, "cmd": "resultant", "ucas": "resultant x^2-1, x-1 in x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "resultant", "p": "x^2 - 1", "q": "x - 1", "var": "x", "result": "0"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "resultant x^2 - 1, x - 1\n  in x: 0\n  zero: a common root (or factor)\n  check: lc(P)^deg(Q) * product of Q over the roots of P = -0 (agrees)\n"}
{"id": 19, "ok": true, "cmd": "discriminant", "ucas": "discriminant x^2+2*x+1 in x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "discriminant", "input": "x^2 + 2x + 1", "var": "x", "degree": 2, "result": "0", "sign": 0}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "discriminant x^2 + 2x + 1\n  in x (degree 2): 0\n  = 0: a repeated root\n  check: lc^(2n-2) * product of (ri - rj)^2 over the roots = 0 (agrees)\n"}
{"id": 20, "ok": true, "cmd": "quo", "ucas": "quo x^3, x in x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "quo", "p": "x^3", "q": "x", "var": "x", "quotient": "x^2", "remainder": "0"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "normal_form", "passed": true, "text": "both sides have the same normal form"}], "proof": {"kind": "symbolic", "text": "both sides have the same normal form over Q"}, "files": [], "text": "quo x^3, x\n  = x^2\n  (in x: P = Q*quotient + remainder, deg remainder < 1)\n  check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)\n"}
